                            Crontab

--> Cron is a linux service that automatically executes commands or 
scripts at a perticular time.

--> insted of executing commands manually you can use cron to automate task.

syntax:

*  *  *  *  *  command
1  2  3  4  5   

1 : Minute (0 - 59)
2 : Hour (0 -23)
3 : Day of Month (1 - 31)
4 : Month (1 - 12)
5 : Day of Week (0 - 7)

30  10  *  *  *  mkdir demo

15 *  *  *  *  touch demo.txt

